# Records docs/audit.gif from the cached answer of 11 October 2026: `vhs docs/audit.tape`. Spends no SerpApi searches.
Output docs/audit.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1560
Set Height 700
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type "source .venv/bin/activate && export SERPAPI_API_KEY=offline-guard PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 400ms
Type 'footnote audit "What is the latest stable release of Rust?"'
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
